+
+The sibling inventory is exact:
+
+```text
+q-root slots: 1 fixed zero root + (Q-1)/A = 2 nonzero A-orbits.
+
+fixed zero root:
+  p-multiplicity b=0, so it is not a p-factor and carries no lower major tree.
+
+selected nonzero orbit:
+  size A=4, p-multiplicity 3 at each conjugate root.
