+| (2) `moh_skeleton_full.py` census samples | CONFIRMED | measured at `t=1,2,3,5,8` |
+| (3) gap-free whole-tree screens | CONFIRMED | symbolic witness, measured at `t=1,2,3,5,8` in both drivers |
+| (4) exact nested-pack DP | CONFIRMED | all `t >= 1`; measured samples agree |
+| (5) Prop.6.3 descent datum and Phi radii | CONFIRMED | all `t >= 1`; p.207 control at `t=1` matches |
+| (6) cofinality consequence | CONFIRMED | gap-free for this family |
+
+Consequence: `Q3(f)` after the screen is **NO**.  The screened census is
+cofinally nonempty via the K16 ray.
+
+## Hash Gate
+
+Every frozen input matched exactly:
+
+```text
+29a6f54dff3dbe2e2ad4cbb07dfdb7b18168e86848d5abb4644f2024f766b82d  screened-census-grok46-20260903.md
+b28e6b3d36c2a6907b4175fb914e29757c5eec3b8a4a82bea3099dc88b6853cf  screened_census.py
