+
+## Final Consequence
+
+The K16 family is not a measured accident.  The Moh `(1)-(13)` arithmetic is
+symbolic in `t`, the whole-tree witness is a nonzero orbit and therefore does
+not rely on the gapped ungated Prop.5.6 zero-chain step, ODE nondegeneracy is
