+
+## 3. Whole-Tree Screens
+
+I checked the requested gap-free screen family with `opus5_probe.py`:
+
+```text
+partition-only, no Prop.5.6 danger       True
+partition + ODE, no Prop.5.6 danger      True
+gated Prop.5.6                           True
+gated Prop.5.6 + ODE                      True
+```
+
+For cross-check, the frozen `full_tree_partition.py` also accepts the selected
+path under its charged screens:
+
+```text
+C_FULL_TREE                              True
+C_FULL_TREE_ODE                          True
+```
+
+This was measured at every requested sample `t=1,2,3,5,8`.  The witness is
+independent of `t` except for the bottom `A1`.
+
+At the only tree level, `j=2`, the partition witness is:
