+```text
+selected orbit: P - Q*3 = 12 - 27 = -15 != 0.
+fixed zero root: b=0, so the positive-zero-root ODE exclusion is not triggered.
+unused q-orbit: p-multiplicity 0 gives P - Q*0 = 12 != 0.
+```
+
+The Prop.5.6 danger flag is cleared by the selected nonzero label before the
+bottom.  Therefore this family does not consume the gapped ungated
+zero-chain use of Prop.5.6.  Survival is gap-free under the repaired/gated
+screen and also survives the stronger charged implementation.
