+```
+
+Result: no vanishing on the K16 ray.  No new exit-price assertion is made in
+this report, so the `charge_basis=...` line from `FALLACY-v2.md` is not
+applicable.
+
+## Final Consequence
+
+The K16 family is not a measured accident.  The Moh `(1)-(13)` arithmetic is
+symbolic in `t`, the whole-tree witness is a nonzero orbit and therefore does
+not rely on the gapped ungated Prop.5.6 zero-chain step, ODE nondegeneracy is
+`12-27 != 0`, nested-pack gives exactly `{6t+3}`, and Prop.6.3/6.4 descends
+the ray to monomial-Jacobian degree pairs
+
+```text
+(n',m'; gamma) = (12t+4, 8t+4; gamma),  t >= 1.
+```
+
+Verdict: **CONFIRMED**.  The family's cofinality is gap-free.  Therefore the
+screened census is cofinally nonempty, and the claimed consequence is typed:
+
+```text
+Q3(f) after the screen is NO.
+```
